The canonical, tool-neutral project rules live in `AGENTS.md` at the repo root. Read it before
editing. Do not duplicate rules here — edit `AGENTS.md` instead.

Essentials (full detail in AGENTS.md):

- Change only the files in the current task card's "Owns" list (`docs/tasks/`); scope is checked by
  `python scripts/check_scope.py <task-id>`.
- Fixed stack: Python 3.12, Flask 3.1, Jinja2, stdlib `sqlite3`, pytest. No ORM, no JS framework, no
  new dependencies beyond `requirements.lock` / `requirements-dev.txt`.
- Never invent names: routes, functions, columns and Flask APIs are frozen in
  `docs/plan/07-CONTRACTS.md`. Business rules come only from `docs/BRIEF.md`.
- Logic (matching, scheduling, auth) is test-first; never weaken, skip or delete a test.
- Gate: `python scripts/check.py` must pass before anything is "done".
- Work on your own `task/Txx` branch; only the integration lead (P2) merges into `dev`.
